# Fashion Blog layout (locked)

Every Shopify article on handle `blog` uses the same storefront templates. Do not invent per-post layouts.

## `/blog` index

- Newest first (`sortKey: PUBLISHED_AT`, `reverse: true`).
- Stack **every** article as a full-bleed `BlogFeatured` cover, one on top of the last. Newest at the top.
- Do not drop older posts into a card grid (`JournalCard` / two-column `feedRest`).
- Keep the night masthead, brass break between covers, and `Latest` only on the first slot.

## `/blog/:handle` article

Guide layout (same template for every post). Do not add per-post templates.

- Breadcrumb: Home / Blog / category
- Category + H1 + byline (author, date, read time)
- Cover image **under** the title (not a full-bleed overlay hero)
- “In short” from excerpt when the body has no `blog-answer`
- “On this page” from H2s; sticky TOC on desktop
- Reading column + `LookAd` rail
- Author bio, share buttons, shop/guide CTAs, previous/next, related guides
- Hub blocks in `contentHtml`: `blog-answer`, `blog-takeaways`, `blog-deeper`, `blog-faq`, `blog-sources`

## Publishing

- Publish to blog handle `blog` only. Journal is separate.
- Hero image required. Body HTML follows `content/blog/voice.md`.
